	measure 'Projeção Ticket Médio' = ```
			
			var data_max = MAX(Calendario1[Date])
			var result = 
			            IF(
			                MAX(Calendario2[Date])>data_max,
			                CALCULATE([Flag_T.M.]*([IPCA Acum 12M previsto]),DATEADD(Calendario2[Date],-1,YEAR)),
			                [Flag_T.M.]
			            )
			return result
			```
		lineageTag: e2a582a6-9a0d-4844-91fd-d20169c6fe07

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isGeneralNumber":true}

